{"title":"The Design of Classic Doctor Who Title Cards","link":"https://kottke.org/25/01/the-design-of-classic-doctor-who-title-cards","date":1736457914000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"681\" alt=\"several title cards from various seasons of Dr Who\" /></p>\n\n<p>While designing a one-off t-shirt for a holiday gift, I stumbled across <a href=\"https://tardis.fandom.com/wiki/Title_cards/Doctor_Who\">this amazing page on the Doctor Who Wiki about the design of the show’s title cards</a>. It’s a pretty thorough resource and includes the typefaces used for the titles — like Grotesque, Eurostile, Futura, Della Robbia, and OPTI Formula One.</p>\n\n<p>I put together a few representative samples from episodes featuring the first four Doctors, after which the designs get less interesting IMO. Enjoy.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1551\" alt=\"several title cards from various seasons of Dr Who\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1548\" alt=\"several title cards from various seasons of Dr Who\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1500\" alt=\"several title cards from various seasons of Dr Who\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-05.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-05.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dr-who-titles-05.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1573\" alt=\"several title cards from various seasons of Dr Who\" /></p>\n\n<p>See also <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nFylN7vK14Q\">a video of All Doctor Who Title Sequences: 1963-2023</a>.</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Doctor%20Who\">Doctor Who</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/TV\">TV</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/typography\">typography</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/01/the-design-of-classic-doctor-who-title-cards\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"da2a13da12f678ee34c86b43d82b8b22549c2c5cc448cff98c5edd93c9551e93","category":"Sites"}